# Keep the image build context minimal: only what `cargo build -p
# recorder-server` needs. Allow-list style so nothing unexpected (frontend,
# docs, git metadata, local secrets) can leak into the image.
#
# Excluded on purpose:
#   target/ node_modules/ src/ dist/ design/ docs/ .git/ *.log .env*
#   .github/ deploy/ rust-toolchain.toml (pins a Windows MSVC toolchain)

# Exclude everything ...
*

# ... then re-include the workspace manifests, lockfile and server crates.
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates
!crates/**

# src-tauri: cargo must parse every member manifest, so re-include the
# directory and its Cargo.toml stub, but keep all other contents out.
!src-tauri
src-tauri/**
!src-tauri/Cargo.toml
